tara:TARA_1992799 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "SP 14" ;
    dcterms:bibliographicCitation """Source for the Acupoint Location: WHO Standard Acupuncture Point Locations in the Western Pacific Region. World Health Organization. Regional Office for the Western Pacific, 2008. Page 76. ISBN 978-92-9061-248-7.

Source for Acupuncture Method, Vasculature, Innervation, and Indications:
