tara:hasAssociatedOrgan a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    dc:description "An object property that relates a meridian to the organ it is associated with according to traditional Chinese medicine theory (e.g., the Lung Meridian is associated with the Lung). Used to express the organ affiliation of a meridian as an OWL axiom." .

